#!name=FlowerCloud Supplement
#!desc=Flower Cloud 托管配置补充分流。策略组名已按 Flower_Trojan.conf 核对。仅补机场未覆盖的部分（域名级去广告 / Claude / Gemini / 个人规则），机场已有的 YouTube、Google、Netflix、Telegram、Apple、China 等不重复引入。
#!author=chenxia31
#!repo=https://github.com/chenxia31/surge-conf
#!category=chenxia31

# 依赖策略组（已确认存在于 Flower_Trojan.conf）：Proxies、OpenAI
#
# 注意：模块规则会插入到主配置 [Rule] 的最前面，因此本模块的 Advertising
# 会先于机场的 Unbreak.list 命中。Unbreak 是用来修复去广告规则误杀的白名单，
# 必须排在 Advertising 之前，故下方重新引入同一份列表（与机场配置同源，链接不含 token）。

[Rule]
# --- 1. 个人规则（最高优先级，误杀时把域名加到 custom.list 即可救回）---
RULE-SET,https://raw.githubusercontent.com/chenxia31/surge-conf/main/rules/custom.list,DIRECT

# --- 2. 误杀白名单（必须在去广告之前）---
RULE-SET,https://api-huacloud.com/getruleset?type=1&url=UHJvZmlsZXMvU3VyZ2UvUnVsZXNldC9VbmJyZWFrLmxpc3Q,DIRECT,update-interval=86400

# --- 3. 个人分流（来自 Quantumult X iPhone-240608 profile）---
RULE-SET,https://raw.githubusercontent.com/chenxia31/surge-conf/main/rules/sets/iPhone240608-Local-DIRECT.list,DIRECT
RULE-SET,https://raw.githubusercontent.com/chenxia31/surge-conf/main/rules/sets/iPhone240608-Local-PROXY.list,Proxies

# --- 4. 域名级去广告（机场只有 URL Rewrite 层，无域名级拦截）---
RULE-SET,https://raw.githubusercontent.com/chenxia31/surge-conf/main/rules/reject.list,REJECT
RULE-SET,https://raw.githubusercontent.com/chenxia31/surge-conf/main/rules/sets/Advertising.list,REJECT

# --- 5. AI 服务（机场仅覆盖 OpenAI，Claude / Gemini / BardAI 需补充）---
RULE-SET,https://raw.githubusercontent.com/chenxia31/surge-conf/main/rules/sets/Claude.list,OpenAI
RULE-SET,https://raw.githubusercontent.com/chenxia31/surge-conf/main/rules/sets/Gemini.list,OpenAI
RULE-SET,https://raw.githubusercontent.com/chenxia31/surge-conf/main/rules/sets/BardAI.list,OpenAI

# --- 机场已覆盖，无需重复引入（保留备查）---
# OpenAI    → 机场 Extra/OpenAI/OpenAI.list  → OpenAI
# YouTube   → 机场 StreamingMedia/Video/YouTube.list → YouTube
# Google    → 机场 Extra/Google/Google.list  → Google
# Netflix / Disney / HBO / Bahamut / Spotify / Steam / Telegram / Microsoft / PayPal / Apple
# China / LocalAreaNetwork → DIRECT，另有 GEOIP,CN,DIRECT 与 FINAL,Final
